      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_01",
      "hash": "e79395d568abbc54",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: Well, my good Pidgey, thanks for the help!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_09",
      "hash": "e7938dd568abaebc",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I think I understand you all a bit better now,\\nthanks to this."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_02",
      "hash": "e79398d568abc16d",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Ah! If it isn’t [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_10",
      "hash": "e79010d568a8a47e",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, of course! I promised to give you and\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)] your Pokémon today, didn’t I?\\c\\nWell, in that case, why don’t we head over to—"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_03",
      "hash": "e79397d568abbfba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_04",
      "hash": "e79392d568abb73b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Wh-what’s this?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_05",
      "hash": "e79391d568abb588",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OAK: That was a pretty fine performance for\\na first timer, my [VAR GENDBR(00FF,0403)]boygirl!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_11",
      "hash": "e79011d568a8a631",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Why don’t you pick up that Poké Ball and give\\nthe [VAR POKNAME(0002)] you caught a name?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_06",
      "hash": "e79394d568abbaa1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What in the—?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_07",
      "hash": "e79393d568abb8ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now, that’s a lively Pokémon if I’ve ever\\nseen one!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0030_new_doctor_08",
      "hash": "e7938ed568abb06f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey! Wait!\\nCome back!"
    }
  ],
